(*---
description: Checks leads_to_set on the reset machine under weak fairness.
ref: tlc2/tool/liveness/LiveCheck.java; tlc2/tool/liveness/Liveness.java
features:
  - liveness
outcome: any
config: |
  SPECIFICATION Spec
  PROPERTY Prop
  CHECK_DEADLOCK FALSE
---*)
---- MODULE live_reset__weak__leads_to_set ----
EXTENDS Integers
VARIABLE x
Next == x' = IF x = 0 THEN 2 ELSE x - 1
Spec == x = 2 /\ [][Next]_x /\ WF_x(Next)
Prop == (x \in {1, 2}) ~> (x = 0)
====

